is equation has no solution, what is the value of $p?$\n\n$p=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477030 1072 #uuid "241cddc7-1f2f-5859-9ab9-bb4fe4e92884" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477030 1074 "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax=b\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are constants, and $b\\ne 0.$ If $a=0,$ then the equation has no solution.\n\nFirst, let's write our equation in the form $az=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(p+2)z-8 & =-3 \\\\ (p+2)z-8+8 & =-3+8 \\\\ {{(p+2)}_{⏟}}_{a}z & ={{5}_{⏟}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has no solution if\n\n$$\np+2=0.\n$$\n\nSolving this for $p,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p+2 & =0 \\\\ p & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477031 1068 #edb/ref 17592186477029 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477031 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477031 1071 "Consider the equation in the variable $w,$ given by\n\n$$\n5(r-5)w-6=4\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is a constant. Given that this equation has no solution, what is the value of $r?$\n\n$r=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477031 1072 #uuid "353a2e9f-97dd-52cc-88ff-dcca6d9658cb" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477031 1074 "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax=b\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are constants, and $b\\ne 0.$ If $a=0,$ then the equation has no solution.\n\nFirst, let's write our equation in the form $aw=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(r-5)w-6 & =4 \\\\ 5(r-5)w-6+6 & =4+6 \\\\ {{5(r-5)}_{⏟}}_{a}w & ={{10}_{⏟}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has no solution if\n\n$$\n5(r-5)=0.\n$$\n\nSolving this for $r,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(r-5) & =0 \\\\ \\frac{5(r-5)}{5} & =\\frac{0}{5} \\\\ r-5 & =0 \\\\ r & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477032 1080 "-2" 13194139535163 17592186045443 true] [17592186477032 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 131941395